<div class="main main-default" id="main">
	<div class="content">
    	<div class="article-bg">
            <img src="../img/layout/article-bg-1.svg" class="article-bg-1" />
            <img src="../img/layout/article-bg-2.svg" class="article-bg-2" />
        </div>
        <div class="article">
        	<h1 class="h1">Resort Dolce Casa - Family &amp; SPA</h1>
            <span class="slogan">Family holiday</span>
            <div class="article-con">
            	<div class="con-left">
                	<p>Welcome to our happy family island!<br />
  A holiday at the Dolce Casa Family Resort &amp; Spa means spending a wonderful time with the most important people in your life: your family.<br /><br />Our premier Family Hotel in the Val di Fassa is in the charming town of Moena, known as the <a href="discovery-the-dolomites.asp">&ldquo;Fairy of the Dolomites&rdquo;</a>; we are situated in a <a href="position.asp">quiet area</a>, but within easy reach of the centre. We are surrounded by some of the most evocative mountain groups in the Dolomites, including the Catinaccio, Monzoni and Latemar. Our resort offers a friendly and <a href="environments.asp">pleasant environment</a> for families, with large <a href="rooms-suites.asp">rooms and suites</a> with balconies and scenic views.</p>
                </div>
            	<div class="con-right">
                	<p>The <a href="super-inclusive.asp">&ldquo;all inclusive&rdquo; formula</a> at the Dolce Casa, the <a href="spa.asp">wellness centre</a> with indoor pools to suit the whole family, and the fantastic world of <a href="tina-land.asp">Tina Land</a> with our trained activity leaders, all ensure you a very special holiday with plenty of fun and relaxation.<br />
  The Sottopietra family, all our staff, and our mascot Tina la Marmottina, will be happy to care for you and your children and give you a truly memorable holiday in the Trentino Dolomites!</p>
                <div class="sign">
            	<p>The</p>
                <img src="../img/layout/sign-en.svg" />
            </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <span class="ten-title">10 good reasons to choose us</span>
            <ul class= "list">
              <li>The Dolce Casa Family Resort &amp; Spa is all about family</li>
              <li><a href="super-inclusive.asp">All-inclusive services</a> for a carefree holiday</li>
              <li>Tina Land for children age 1 and upward, with supervision and activities 13 hours a day</li>
              <li>Weekly Tina Baby, Mini and Junior programmes with assistants and professional entertainers</li>
              <li>Swimming pools for children and adults and an exclusive spa for parents</li>
              <li>Beauty centre with massages, treatments and pampering for mum and dad</li>
              <li>Special Tina ski school</li>
              <li>More free time for parents &ndash; to enjoy time together</li>
              <li>Central location in Moena, near all the places of interest</li>
              <li>Surrounded by the most beautiful mountains in the world: The UNESCO Dolomites</li>
            	</ul>
             
                <img src="../img/layout/award.png" alt="Travelers Award" class="award">
        </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="core-section">
    
    	<div class="core core-1">
        	<div class="core-bg"></div>
        	<div class="core-descr">
                <div class="core-descr-in">
                    <span class="core-title">Children<br /> &amp; Babies</span>
                    <span class="core-sub">Only the best for our little guests!<br /> Our Tina Land programme offers a wide selection of activities, games and services for different age groups. The Dolce Casa has a carefully selected team of activity leaders, ready to entertain your children from morning to night.</span>
                    <a href="children-babies.asp">More</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="core-box"></div>
            <div  class="core-img"><div><img src="../img/layout/desktop/kids.png" /></div></div>
        </div>
        
    	<div class="core core-2">
        	<div class="core-bg"></div>
        	<div class="core-overlay"></div>
        	<div class="core-descr">
                <div class="core-descr-in">
                    <span class="core-title">Wellness<br /> &amp; SPA</span>
                    <span class="core-sub">While your children are having fun in Tina Land, you can give yourself a well-earned break, and enjoy the pleasures of our wellness centre and spa. We offer various different types of sauna, a swimming pool with Jacuzzi, and a huge choice of wellness treatments for all the family.</span>
                    <a href="spa.asp">More</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    
    	<div class="core core-3">
        	<div class="core-bg"></div>
        	<div class="core-descr">
                <div class="core-descr-in">
                    <span class="core-title">Family<br /> &amp; Parents</span>
                    <span class="core-sub">The best thing we offer at Dolce Casa is lots of time for your children. With our varied family programme, a holiday together will never be so good: a unique opportunity to experience the mountains and explore the beautiful Val di Fassa.</span>
                    <a href="family-parents.asp">More</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="core-box"></div>
            <div  class="core-img"><div><img src="../img/layout/desktop/family.png" /></div></div>
        </div>
	
    </div>
    
    <div class="key-section">
    	<div class="key-bg"></div>
    	<div class="key-inner">
        	<div class="key-top">
            	<span class="hr"></span><span class="key-top-title">Dolce Casa</span><span class="hr"></span>
                <span class="key-top-sub">Your vacantion</span>
            </div>
        	
            <div class="key-bottom">
            	<a href="rooms-suites.asp"><div class="key key-1">
                	<div class="key-hov-1"></div>
                	<div class="key-hov-2"></div>
                	<div class="key-in">
                        <span class="key-title"><span class="key-box"></span><font>Rooms<br /> &amp; suites</font></span>
                        <span class="key-sub"><span class="hr"></span>Spacious and comfortable</span>
                        <p>Family rooms and communicating rooms, to meet all the needs of families with older or younger children.</p>
                        <div class="key-img"><div class="key-over"></div></div>
                    </div>
                </div></a>
				
            	<a href="offers-packages.asp"><div class="key key-2-s">
                
                	<div class="key-hov-1"></div>
                	<div class="key-hov-2"></div>
                	<div class="key-in">
                        <span class="key-title"><span class="key-box"></span><font>Prices &amp; offers</font></span>
                        <span class="key-sub"><span class="hr"></span>Advantages for families</span>
                        <p>Explore our top summer and winter offers, specially designed for you.</p>
                        <div class="key-img"><div class="key-over"></div></div>
                    </div>
                </div></a>
            	<a href="super-inclusive.asp"><div class="key key-3">
                	<div class="key-hov-1"></div>
                	<div class="key-hov-2"></div>
                	<div class="key-in">
                        <span class="key-title"><span class="key-box"></span><font>All<br /> inclusive</font></span>
                        <span class="key-sub"><span class="hr"></span>Family-friendly services</span>
                        <p>Take advantage of our All Inclusive Dolce Casa and All Inclusive Small formulas for your family holiday in Trentino.</p>
                        <div class="key-img"><div class="key-over"></div></div>
                    </div>
                </div></a>
            	<a href="price.asp"><div class="key key-4">
                	<div class="key-hov-1"></div>
                	<div class="key-hov-2"></div>
                	<div class="key-in">
                        <span class="key-title"><span class="key-box"></span><font>Best price<br /> guarantee</font></span>
                        <span class="key-sub"><span class="hr"></span>Book now</span>
                        <p>By booking directly on the Dolce Casa website, you are guaranteed the best possible price.</p>
                        <div class="key-img"><div class="key-over"></div></div>
                    </div>
                </div></a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    
</div>

<div class="request-section">
    <div class="requ-bg"></div>
    <div class="request-inner">
    	<div class="requ-top">
            <span class="hr"></span><span class="requ-top-title">Book at the best price</span><span class="hr"></span>
            <span class="requ-top-sub">Check availability</span>
        </div>
        
        <div class="requ-box">
            <form class="quick-request" name="SmallForm" id="SmallForm" action="request.asp" method="post">
                
                <div class="qr-col">
                    <div class="qr-row">
                        <div class="qr-row-box" id="qr-row-box-1">
